WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.640
Don't fight in the north or the south

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.740
Fight every battle, everywhere

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.840
Always

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.080
In your mind

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.340
For centuries our families fought together

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.800
Against their common enemy

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.800
Despite their differences

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:53.880
Together

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:57.320
we need to do the same if we're gonna survive

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:00.140
'cause the enemy is real

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:06.740
Its always been real

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:36.000
When the snows fall and the white winds blow

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:38.920
The lone wolf dies

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:41.900
But the pack survives

